.Dd November 27, 2026
.Dt TALUS 1
.Os macOS 15.0
.Sh NAME
.Nm talus
.Nd XMonad-inspired tiling window manager for macOS
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl -settings
.Op Fl -settings-only
.Op Fl -tab Ns = Ns Ar general | layout | rules | status
.Op Fl -render-icon Ar out.png
.Op Fl -render-previews Ar dir
.Op Fl -probe-login-item
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a deterministic, XMonad-inspired tiling window manager for macOS 15+
(Apple Silicon), written in 100% pure Geisha using native AppKit,
Accessibility
.Pq Dv AXUIElement ,
Carbon global hotkeys, and
.Dv SMAppService .
No X11 server, SIP modifications, or process injection are required.
.Pp
.Nm
arranges visible windows into
.Cm Tall ,
.Cm Mirror Tall ,
or
.Cm Full
layouts with configurable outer and inner gaps, supports either native macOS
Spaces or zero-animation virtual workspaces
.Pq 1\(en9
with 1px corner parking and atomic session persistence, renders an
xmobar-inspired menu-bar status item, and provides a native AppKit Settings
window that preserves comments when editing
.Pa ~/.talus.toml .
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl -settings
Start
.Nm
normally and immediately open the native Settings window.
.It Fl -settings-only
Open only the Settings window without starting window tiling, AX observers,
or global hotkeys.
.It Fl -tab Ns = Ns Ar name
Select the initial Settings tab when used with
.Fl -settings
or
.Fl -settings-only .
Valid values are
.Cm general ,
.Cm layout ,
.Cm rules ,
and
.Cm status .
.It Fl -render-icon Ar out.png
Render the 1024\(mu1024 vector application icon PNG to
.Ar out.png
and exit.
.It Fl -render-previews Ar dir
Render 2\(mu Retina light and dark Settings window screenshots into
.Ar dir
and exit.
.It Fl -probe-login-item
Run an isolated
.Dv SMAppService.mainApp
register/read/unregister verification probe.
Refuses to run unless executed from a bundle whose identifier is
.Li local.talus.testing.login .
.El
.Sh KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS
All shortcuts combine the configured
.Va modifiers
chord (default
.Ic Control + Option ,
written
.Ic <Mod>
below) with a key.
.Ic Shift
is reserved for swapping and throwing windows.
.Bl -tag -width "<Mod>+Shift+1..9" -compact
.It Ic <Mod>+J / K
Focus next / previous window on the active display.
.It Ic <Mod>+Shift+J / K
Swap focused window with next / previous window.
.It Ic <Mod>+Return
Swap focused window with master (or first stack window if already master).
.It Ic <Mod>+H / L
Shrink / expand master pane width by
.Va ratio_step .
.It Ic <Mod>+, / .
Increment / decrement the number of master windows.
.It Ic <Mod>+Space
Cycle layout:
.Cm Tall
\(->
.Cm Mirror Tall
\(->
.Cm Full .
.It Ic <Mod>+T
Toggle floating for the focused window.
.It Ic <Mod>+P
Pause or resume tiling (restores parked windows while paused).
.It Ic <Mod>+1..9
Switch to virtual workspace 1..count
.Pq when Va mode = \(dqvirtual\(dq .
.It Ic <Mod>+Shift+1..9
Move the focused window to virtual workspace 1..count
.Pq when Va mode = \(dqvirtual\(dq .
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width "TALUS_LEGACY_FOCUS"
.It Ev TALUS_CONFIG
Override configuration file search order with an explicit
.Pa .toml
or
.Pa .json
path (supports leading
.Pa ~ ) .
.It Ev TALUS_LEGACY_FOCUS
When set to
.Li 1 ,
force the legacy full focus activation sequence instead of the optimized
.Fn _SLPSGetFrontProcess
path.
.It Ev TALUS_TRACE_EVENTS
When set to
.Li 1 ,
log Accessibility, workspace, and executor diagnostic events to standard error.
.It Ev TALUS_TRACE_STATUS
When set to
.Li 1 ,
log menu-bar status rendering diagnostics to standard error.
.It Ev TALUS_TEST_PID
Restrict window management to specific process ID(s) during automated tests.
.It Ev TALUS_TEST_HOTKEYS
When set to
.Li 1 ,
keep global Carbon hotkeys enabled even when
.Ev TALUS_TEST_PID
is set.
.El
.Sh FILES
Unless
.Ev TALUS_CONFIG
is set,
.Nm
searches for configuration in the following order:
.Bl -tag -width Ds -compact
.It Pa ~/.talus.toml
Primary user configuration file.
.It Pa ~/.config/talus/config.toml
XDG-style fallback configuration file.
.It Pa ~/Library/Application Support/Talus/config.toml
macOS Application Support TOML fallback.
.It Pa ~/Library/Application Support/Talus/config.json
Legacy JSON fallback (migrated to
.Pa ~/.talus.toml
on first UI save).
.It Pa ~/Library/Application Support/Talus/session-state.json
Atomic
.Pq Li 0600
virtual workspace session persistence file.
.It Pa /Applications/Talus.app
Canonical macOS application bundle installation path.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh DIAGNOSTICS
.Bl -diag
.It "Accessibility permission required"
Grant permission to
.Pa /Applications/Talus.app
in
.Dq System Settings \(-> Privacy & Security \(-> Accessibility .
For local builds, run
.Ic make setup-cert
once so code signatures persist across rebuilds.
.It "Invalid configuration"
Reported to standard error (or via an AppKit alert when launched as an app)
at startup; invalid live edits are logged without terminating the active
session.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr talus.toml 5
